 (The First Try)\nAt the very beginning, your robot chef has no idea what it’s doing.\n* You give it a bowl of flour, sugar, and chocolate, and say, "Make a cookie!" \n\nThe robot throws in a handful of salt, dumps in a gallon of milk, and maybe throws in a shoe for good measure.\n* It puts this mess in the oven and pulls out something that looks like a burnt brick.\n* The "Feedback" Phase (The Taste Test)\nYou take a bite (yuck!) and give the robot a "score." You say, "That was a 0 out of 10.'}
